: 16338}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "232481746", "author": {"steamid": "76561198330070777", "personaname": "Zuckz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198330070777/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 489, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 489, "last_played": 1726346143, "avatar": "913f2f224f78d0be14ae0829a12c08e353ac7322"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Si tenes ganas de apagar el cerebro y reventar zombies con amigos pero con mejores graficos que el L4D2... recomendado.", "timestamp_created": 1786336113, "timestamp_updated": 1786336113, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "232418143", "author": {"steamid": "76561197984828178", "personaname": "dvLL [ss]", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197984828178/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 13677, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 13677, "last_played": 1783487686, "avatar": "6410fe435cb4823fd2c701d6df6d67c83619e095"}, "language": "latam", "review": "me gusto mucho", "timestamp_created": 1786272519, "timestamp_updated": 1786272519, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "232156066", "author": {"steamid": "76561198908705823", "personaname": "Dei", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198908705823/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 2256, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2256, "last_played": 1786753504, "avatar": "4ed6d4dfb74eb255183ab7d0b4f746057342bf48"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Edit: Después de completar todas las campañas, explorar las cartas y conocer mejor sus mecánicas, mi perspectiva ha cambiado un poco. El juego sigue sin estar mal y su propuesta me parece interesante, pero con el tiempo se vuelve bastante monótono. El principal problema es que fue abandonado y, una vez terminas las campañas, no hay demasiado contenido que mantenga el interés a largo plazo. El Director termina recurriendo a situaciones y variantes bastante predecibles, por lo que las partidas empiezan a sentirse repetitivas.\n\nSigo pensando que Back 4 Blood merece una oportunidad si puedes disfrutarlo por lo que es y no como un sustituto de Left 4 Dead, pero es importante tener en cuenta que su mayor problema actualmente no es su jugabilidad, sino la falta de contenido y soporte a largo plazo.", "timestamp_created": 1785975791, "timestamp_updated": 1787344758, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}